Switchblade Sisters is a 1975 American exploitation action film
detailing the lives of high school-aged female gang members.

11
00:52:41,052 --> 00:52:47,052
It was directed by Jack Hill and stars Joanne Nail, Robbie Lee and Monica Gayle.

12
