The film is also known as The Jezebels, Maggie's Stiletto
Sisters and The Warriors II: Las Navajeras.

13
01:02:15,789 --> 01:02:21,789
The movie was not a success at the box office, but
garnered a cult following later on.

14
01:07:03,157 --> 01:07:09,157
Most of its current popularity can be attributed to film director Quentin Tarantino, who named the picture
a personal favorite and re-released it in 1996 under his Rolling Thunder Pictures label.

15
